    // shadow on a normal-mapped strap, RenderVKShadowMoverMask 0 correct). The gate was w > 0.002 -- the smooth
    // normal's N.l. Where the smooth normal grazes or just turns from a light (N.l <= 0) while the normal map's
    // stripes still face it, pass 15 shades that light (projDirectTerms: the MAPPED normal, N.l > 0), but the mask
