// THE REST RATIO 1 - lost / d per channel (lost = sum w Vs (1 - Vm), d = sum w Vs; the luminance's where d barely has
// a channel), clamped to [0, 1]. Where d is ~0 -- no static light reaches the texel, pass 15's radiance is ~0 -- the
// same over the unshadowed weights (lostFb = sum w (1 - Vm), dFb = sum w): one light gives exactly its Vm.
vec3 mvRestRatio(vec3 lost, vec3 d, vec3 lostFb, vec3 dFb)
{
